98
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:35,760
The point to make is that these differences are most apparent at the neonate or infant

99
00:06:35,760 --> 00:06:40,860
end of the spectrum and less marked for pediatrics as age goes up.

100
00:06:40,860 --> 00:06:45,180
So let's take a moment and focus on the left end of the spectrum and talk about neonatal

101
00:06:45,180 --> 00:06:46,580
and infant airway management.

