and into the airways, especially when that end extends past the ET tube.

150
00:10:08,680 --> 00:10:14,360
That said, stylets do allow the clinician to dictate the shape of the tool and may facilitate

151
00:10:14,360 --> 00:10:16,460
the correct placement.

