00:12:06,480 --> 00:12:10,820
And in the case that a preferred technique isn't compatible with all size ranges, using

179
00:12:10,820 --> 00:12:15,560
the equipment on hand at a given service, there are valid alternatives available.

180
00:12:15,560 --> 00:12:20,720
Having a bougie on hand also offers some flexibility if things get weird.

