00:12:35,060 --> 00:12:39,260
It's also good to have the bougie immediately available if a crec needs to be performed,

186
00:12:39,260 --> 00:12:41,220
or a chest tube.

187
00:12:41,220 --> 00:12:45,180
All that said, here's where we stand on the issue at this point in time.

188
00:12:45,180 --> 00:12:49,620
If bougies are available, use them during the initial intubation attempt.

189
00:12:49,620 --> 00:12:52,940
If pediatric ones are available, use them.

190
00:12:52,940 --> 00:12:56,520
If the itty bitty ones are there too, use them also.

191
00:12:56,520 --> 00:12:59,340
But a couple of caveats here.

192
00:12:59,340 --> 00:13:03,500
Follow these steps for best practice.

193
00:13:03,500 --> 00:13:08,080
Practice using the thing in all its different size iterations so that time isn't lost when

194
00:13:08,080 --> 00:13:09,780
push comes to shove.

